## Interface: 20506
## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Ping
## Author: Devin
## Version: 2.2.0
## Notes: RTS-style minimap ping alerts: sound, an expanding flash, and a callout whenever a group member pings the map. With Commander Orders, the callout's [Waypoint] link points the arrow at the pinged spot, or every ping can become a waypoint by itself.
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Ability_Warrior_RallyingCry
## SavedVariables: CommanderPingDB
## RequiredDeps: Commander_Events
## OptionalDeps: Commander_Orders

